From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: feuristic build <build@feuristic.invalid>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 07:22:43 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feuristic: link feuristic sources into the upstream tree

Relative symlinks give the upstream build access to the feuristic
MicroPython package (src/feuristic), the feuristic kernel/upymod C code
(firmware/) and the portable C libraries (lib/) without copying them.

Feuristic-Rationale: single source of truth; upstream build scripts are
reused unchanged.

diff --git a/core/embed/feuristic b/core/embed/feuristic
new file mode 120000
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..168246ceafbbc1b6f089edec53d920c804ac5f72
--- /dev/null
+++ b/core/embed/feuristic
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+../../../../firmware
\ No newline at end of file
diff --git a/core/embed/feuristic_lib b/core/embed/feuristic_lib
new file mode 120000
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..42892ea045a92fc3dfda67cba812050e5c9c13a2
--- /dev/null
+++ b/core/embed/feuristic_lib
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+../../../../lib
\ No newline at end of file
diff --git a/core/src/feuristic b/core/src/feuristic
new file mode 120000
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..ab8bda82d811799980f3ecd2ed38a42d6fcef361
--- /dev/null
+++ b/core/src/feuristic
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+../../../../src/feuristic
\ No newline at end of file
